<div class="container projects-section">
    <div class="text-center page-hero"><h1>Projects Index</h1></div>
    <p class="section-intro">Welcome to my projects index! Below is a list of all projects that I have worked on, am working on, or have
        contributed to over time. You can click a project card to learn more about a specific project. Not every
        project I have worked on may be listed on this page. To see more things I have worked on that may not be
        listed here, you can visit my GitHub, which you can find by clicking the icon in the footer of the page.</p>
    {{#iff projects.length ">" 0}}
        <div class="row project-grid">
            {{#each projects as |projects| }}
                <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6 col-xs-12">
                    <div class="project-card">
                        <a href="/projects/{{ projects._id }}">
                            <div class="project-card-image">
                                <img class="greyimg" src="/images/{{ projects.project_image }}"
                                     alt="{{ projects.project_title }}">
                            </div>
                            <div class="project-card-title">{{ projects.project_title }}</div>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            {{/each}}
        </div>
    {{else}}
        <hr>
        <p class="section-intro">There are no published projects at this time.</p>
    {{/iff}}
</div>
